import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This website uses Umami to understand page visits and clicks on CV, PDF,
    email, and external links. Email click events do not include the email address,
    and Umami page URLs and link destinations exclude query strings and fragments.</p>
  <p>Microsoft Clarity helps me understand how visitors use the site through
    interaction data, heatmaps, and session replays. Clarity is configured with
    analytics and advertising cookie storage denied; this limits its ability to
    connect activity across pages. Clarity receives usage data as described in the
    <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</p>
  <p>The site does not load these analytics trackers when your browser enables
    Do Not Track. Clarity also does not load when Global Privacy Control is enabled.
    Browser extensions may block analytics independently.</p>
  <p>Cloudflare provides hosting-related traffic and security analytics, and Google
    Search Console reports how this site appears in Google Search. These services
    do not provide me with visitors' names or email addresses.</p>
</PageLayout>
